Subject: [PATCH 1401/1463] HERESY 1447: each half its own cap; the waves move
 without a word
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A budget's cap for the music half and the sound half apart ("cap", "cap_nar"): their red lines differ, 2.25 against 1.5. Viktor 15.10.2026, of the stage's words: «К хуям убери этот лог арки. Он там не нужен»: a slider's or a LoRA's wave no longer says where it stands every 250 steps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/lora-rt.h   |  5 ++---
 src/pipeline.h  | 20 +++++++++++---------
 src/request.cpp |  3 +++
 src/request.h   |  5 +++--
 src/sliders.h   |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/lora-rt.h b/src/lora-rt.h
index e1bb3b1..b52e2c2 100644
--- a/src/lora-rt.h
+++ b/src/lora-rt.h
@@ -221,15 +221,14 @@ static void lora_rt_frames(const LoraRtSet * set, int start, int frames, int spa
     lora_rt_at(set, mid > 1.0f ? 1.0f : mid, true, say ? "the sound half's chunk, at its middle" : nullptr);
 }
 
-// The music half's gains at a step of the music, t = (kept + step) / (kept + budget), as the sliders count it; every 250
-// steps the log says where each adapter stands
+// The music half's gains at a step of the music, t = (kept + step) / (kept + budget), as the sliders count it
 static void lora_rt_progress(const LoraRtSet * set, int step, int budget) {
     if (!lora_rt_active(set)) {
         return;
     }
     const float span = (float) (set->kept + budget);
     float       t    = span > 0.0f ? (float) (set->kept + step) / span : 0.0f;
-    lora_rt_at(set, t, false, step > 0 && (step % 250) == 0 ? "into the music" : nullptr);
+    lora_rt_at(set, t, false, nullptr);   // without a word as it goes (Viktor 15.10.2026: «К хуям убери этот лог арки»)
 }
 
 // Build the set for one half on the model's backend. `src` holds the run's adapters on this path, opened at strength 1
